{"html": "<section class=\"mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-6\">Markdown Syntax Quick Reference</h2><div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-[var(--border)]\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-sm\"><thead class=\"bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><tr><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\" scope=\"col\">Element</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\" scope=\"col\">Markdown Syntax</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\" scope=\"col\">Rendered Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Heading 1</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\"># Heading 1</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><div aria-level=\"1\" data-heading-id=\"qr-heading-1-heading-1\" id=\"qr-heading-1-heading-1\" role=\"heading\">Heading 1</div>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Largest heading</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Heading 2</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">## Heading 2</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><div aria-level=\"2\" data-heading-id=\"qr-heading-2-heading-2\" id=\"qr-heading-2-heading-2\" role=\"heading\">Heading 2</div>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Section heading</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Bold</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">**bold text**</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><strong>bold text</strong></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">bold text</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Italic</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">*italic text*</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><em>italic text</em></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">italic text</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Bold + Italic</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">***bold italic***</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><em><strong>bold italic</strong></em></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">bold italic</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Strikethrough</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">~~struck through~~</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><del>struck through</del></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">struck through</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Inline code</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">`code`</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><code>code</code></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">code</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Link</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">[title](https://example.com)</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><a href=\"https://example.com\">title</a></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">title (clickable)</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Image</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">![alt text](image.jpg)</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><p><img alt=\"alt text\" src=\"/cheat-sheet-icon.svg\"/></p>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">embedded image</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Unordered list</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">- Item 1\n- Item 2</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><ul>\n<li>Item 1</li>\n<li>Item 2</li>\n</ul>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">bulleted list</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Ordered list</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">1. First\n2. Second</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><ol>\n<li>First</li>\n<li>Second</li>\n</ol>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">numbered list</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Task list</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">- [x] Done\n- [ ] Todo</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><ul>\n<li><input aria-label=\"Completed\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Done</li>\n<li><input aria-label=\"Not completed\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Todo</li>\n</ul>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">checkbox list</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Blockquote</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">&gt; quoted text</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><blockquote>\n<p>quoted text</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">indented quote</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Code block</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">```js\ncode\n```</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-js\">code</code></pre></div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">fenced code block</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Table</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">| A | B |\n| - | - |\n| 1 | 2 |</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>B</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">data table</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)]\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-[var(--text-primary)] whitespace-nowrap\" scope=\"row\">Horizontal rule</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\"><code class=\"font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] whitespace-pre-wrap\">---</code></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\"><div class=\"markdown-preview markdown-preview-inline\"><hr/>\n</div><span class=\"mt-1 block text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]\">divider line</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Every row on the right is the real rendered output, not a description of it.</p></section>", "cssUrls": ["/_next/static/chunks/1ltg7s547_d2v.css?dpl=dpl_8B2V3n1KLLHpYgdAhQeBbwoHPRH6", "/_next/static/chunks/1u2ey8fzq2uo1.css?dpl=dpl_8B2V3n1KLLHpYgdAhQeBbwoHPRH6"]}